------------------------------------------------------------------------------
      r =        1 pc:  ratio = 4.050e-03
      r =       30 pc:  ratio = 4.392e-06
      r =     1000 pc:  ratio = 4.242e-09
      r =    10000 pc:  ratio = 4.145e-11
  [PASS] C2 [SCALE SEPARATION] the biharmonic term vanishes FASTER than the
