G204 READING:  9 PASS / 0 FAIL
==============================================================================

THE VERDICT -- DEAD (the combined operator still ghosts AND breaks the break)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  (a) THE GHOST TEST:  NOT FIXED AT ANY FINITE xi.
      P_X = -f' = -mu_2 < 0 is INVARIANT (the biharmonic is a spatial,
      X-independent operator: H004's own F1); the per-mode form
      Q(k,th) = -c k^2 + xi^2 k^4 stays negative at k -> 0 for every xi; the
      affine modes {a + b.x} lie in the kernel of Delta^2 and carry the
      negative gradient energy -c P at every xi.  The Hessian stays
      INDEFINITE (lambda_min < 0 verified over 18 decades of xi).  The
      curved sector is healed above xi_c3 ~ 0.06-0.09 pc -- that is the
      part of the spectrum the k^4 term renormalizes -- but one healthy
      sector is not health.  V1: P_X = -0.17 (u = 0.1) / -0.75 (u = 1.0),
      G^00 = -f' < 0, xi_c = none-in-the-IR -> infinity.

  (b) THE CASSINI GATE:  FAIL(EV).
      The propagator (1 - e^{-r/xi})/r is EXACTLY the isotropic Helmholtz
      single filter of the G03 44-solve scan; the smooth-shell lemma
      applies verbatim (the quadrupole is the transition shell's l=2
      moment, untouched by isotropic radial smoothing); the registered
      min over the scan is 6.18x the Park ceiling, and at the parent's own
      xi = 0.045 pc it is 6.45x (canonical) / 7.65x (alternative) -- a
      Mercury drift of 0.26/0.31 arcsec/cy against 0 +/- 0.04.  The H014
      local reading (suppression at Saturn ~1e-6) is REGISTERED AND
      SUPERSEDED: the quadrupole is generated at r ~ 8000 AU, where the
      kernel's own suppression is O(0.4) (verified above).

  (c) THE DEEP GATE:  PASSES, AND THE CONFLICT DOES NOT MATERIALIZE.
      delta rho/rho_ph = 2 (xi/r)^2 -> 0: 4e-7 at 0.1 kpc, 4e-9 at 1 kpc,
      4e-11 at 10 kpc.  The r^-2 phantom (equipartition exactness) is
      untouched; the xi-scale is confined below ~pc.

  V3 -- THE HONEST STATEMENT (the k^4 family's fate):
      H001 (bare k-essence): killed by H045 (ghost, -90 arcsec/cy).
      H004 (biharmonic screened parent, THIS lane): the ghost survives at
      every xi (P_X invariant; affine kernel), Cassini fails at its own
      xi (6.45x/7.65x), deep survives -- DEAD.
      f31/H006 (whole-sector stiffening): Pais-Uhlenbeck doublet expected,
      and the static limit is the same scanned operator (g03 C2) -- dead.
      The k^4 family has NO surviving member.  H048 DOOR 1 is CLOSED:
      there is no screened parent in this class; the relativistic
      completion question reverts to H048 DOOR 4 (the sourced equation)
      and the equilibrium reading (G03 verdict: the phantom is ABSENT in
      the Solar System by the EFE cap, Cassini passes by construction).

